Battling a vampire lord I got the message You feel uncontrolled! and
thought uh-oh, I just lost TC. But I hadn't. So what was that message
all about?

Following this train of thought: how exactly does 'stealing intrinsics'
work? I've heard on the net that gremlins can steal intrinsics, so much
so that some folks like to genocide them, but in all my dealings with
them I've never noticed anything. How do you know when you lose an
intrinsic: do you get the opposite message (You feel infirm, You
deflate like a pricked hot-air balloon, etc?) Or is it like losing ESP
(no message, you won't know until the next time you're blind)? The
latter possibility is pretty unsettling: I wouldn't like to find out
when I'm "basking in the black glow of a wide-angle disintegration beam"
that I lost my resistance to it 20 levels ago to that 10 HP gremlin.

